<<
/A 34 0 R
/Alt (Diagram divided into three sections. Left: "FD patients and disease models" with icons of people and a mouse. Middle: "Systemic metabolism and microbiota dysbiosis" with charts and graphs. Right: "Precision medicine" with molecular pathways, survival graphs, and probiotic and dietary intervention illustrations. Each section represents different aspects of disease understanding and treatment strategies.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 23 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
endobj
16 0 obj
<<
/A 34 0 R
/Alt (Outline of a human silhouette showing internal organs with two labeled sections: "Metabolic alterations" mentioning oxidative stress, TCA cycle, and amino acid metabolism, and "Gut microbiota alterations" listing changes in specific bacteria and compounds. Additionally, a box lists symptoms: mitochondrial dysfunction, immune dysregulation, neurological, and gastrointestinal symptoms.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 30 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
endobj
